sessions/persona-classifier-research/analysis.md:254:| **Upworthy** (22,743 confirmatory tests) | In the archive: every variant's headline text + image ID | Reconstructable once via Wayback Machine (upworthy.com 2013–15); headline tests need little more than site/story context | **None available.** Synthetic panel calibrated to the documented audience (Facebook-referred, skewed female, liberal-leaning US social-media users — archive paper + Pew 2013–14 social-media surveys). Demographic-grade only. |
