sessions/agent-behavior-spec/context.md:21:  - **USER DECISION (loop iter 2):** build §3a per-metric outcome elicitation next. **BUILD SCOPE (backend, per `elicitation-conversion.md`):** (1) `schemas/simulation.py:Hypothesis` gains a structured target-metric (`metric_name`, `conversion_action`+`_label`, `decision_point`, `choice_set` w/ fallback {convert, defer/keep-browsing, leave, comparison-shop}); absent `metric_name` → today's sentiment path UNCHANGED (backwards-compat). (2) New turn-2 elicitor: in-character 10-trial allocation via `chat_json` → `{action_counts(sum=10), primary_reason, self_reported_confidence}`; `p_conv = counts[label]/10`; conditioned on turn-1 reaction + frozen identity; runs per agent PER ARM. (3) `simulation_runner.py` wiring after the reaction. (4) Aggregation in `scoring.py`/`scoring_ab`: `lift_i = p_conv(T_i)−p_conv(C_i)` on paired seeds (#90), persona-weight-weighted panel lift, paired-bootstrap CI, reported in pp ALONGSIDE existing sentiment `confidence_score` (not replacing). (5) §5 honesty: behavioral weak-regime label, pre-#222 = rank+direction+relative only (never a bare "+5pp" as truth), keep #91 disclaimer. **Frontend result-card surfacing = separate follow-up (out of scope).** **APPROACH:** delegated to a worktree-isolated fork (inherits full context); fork runs GitNexus impact analysis → build → pytest/ruff/black → codex → opens PR to main (NOT merged); I review + relay blast radius before merge.
