mulation_runner.py:364` + `test_prompt_composer.py`; MEDIUM (changes frozen treatment+control preamble for *new* sims only; frozen identities ⇒ no existing sim affected). 32 §2 tests (14 renderer-honesty incl. malformed/typical/threshold + 4 composer-wiring) pass; full backend **593 pass / 1 pre-existing unrelated frontend failure** (`test_deploy_config`) / 11 skip; ruff+black clean; **codex review clean** (P3 fixed, re-reviewed). Live for all NEW sims (frozen identity ⇒ existing sims unchanged).
